# Etsy upload guide - {{ title }}

Time needed: about 20 minutes. Open **Shop Manager > Listings > Add a listing**.

## 1. Photos (upload in this order, 10 max)
{% for img in images -%}
{{ loop.index }}. `{{ img }}`
{% endfor %}
{% if video %}- **Video (optional, 1 per listing):** `{{ video[0] }}` - add it in the photo section (5-15 s works best).
{% endif %}- Etsy recommends images at least 2000 px on the shortest side (4:3 ratio, 2700 x 2025 works well). These are already sized.
- The first image is your thumbnail in search - check it is readable at a small size.
{% if has_xlsx %}- **Spreadsheet products:** `images/etsy/07-spreadsheet-illustration.jpg` is a drawn illustration of the layout with sample numbers. Add 1-2 real screenshots of the workbook open in Excel or Google Sheets (Dashboard + Budget/Tracker sheet) as photos 7 and 8. Buyers trust real screenshots.
{% endif %}
## 2. Title (max 140 characters)
```
{{ copy.title }}
```
({{ copy.title|length }} characters)

## 3. About this listing
- Who made it: **I did**  | What is it: **A finished product**  | When was it made: **2020 - 2026**
- **AI content disclosure:** tick that AI tools were used and paste the disclosure line into the description (included below). Etsy requires disclosure in the listing description, not in tags or photos.
- Category: {{ category or "pick the closest match Etsy suggests for a printable/planner (e.g. under **Paper & Party Supplies > Paper**). Browse similar best-selling listings to confirm." }}

## 4. Type and files
- Choose **Digital** and upload your files (up to 5 files, 20 MB each, total 100 MB):
{% for f in files -%}
  - `{{ f }}`
{% endfor %}
## 5. Price
**${{ "%.2f"|format(price) }}**  - {{ price_note }}

## 6. Tags (13 max, 20 characters each)
```
{{ copy.tags|join(', ') }}
```

## 7. Description
Paste this (it includes the AI disclosure and terms):
```
{{ description }}
```

## 8. Attributes & settings
- Primary colour: {{ colour }}
- Occasion/holiday: leave blank unless it truly applies.
- Renewal: **Automatic** (4 months), Quantity: 999.
- Turn on **Etsy Ads** only after the first sales; keep the first two weeks organic + Pinterest.

## 9. Publish checklist
- [ ] Open each downloadable file and check it opens correctly
- [ ] Preview the listing on mobile
- [ ] Title reads naturally (no keyword stuffing)
- [ ] AI disclosure included in the description
- [ ] Save a draft, wait, and re-read before publishing

## 10. After publishing
1. Share the listing link into your Pinterest pins (see `guide-pinterest.md`).
2. Log the listing in the MoneyHub dashboard so sales can be matched to this product.
3. After 4 weeks compare views, favourites and sales, then decide: tweak title/photos, change price, or make a variation in this niche.
